    skos:prefLabel 'Watersheds'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A watershed is a term for a drainage basin: an extent of land where water from rain or snow melt drains downhill into a body of water, such as a river, lake, reservoir, estuary, wetland, sea or ocean.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:A02::Watershed'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A02/current/Waves/1/> .
